msgid "Sky-Drones AIRLink Overview"
msgstr "Sky-Drones AIRLink 概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skydrones-airlink.rst:9
#: 97a5d66038bc4806b6a6e0b57561aa80
msgid ""
"`AIRLink  <https://sky-drones.com/airlink>`__ stands for Artificial "
"Intelligence & Remote Link. The unit includes a cutting-edge drone "
"autopilot, AI mission computer and LTE connectivity unit. AIRLink helps to "
"reduce the time to market for new drone manufacturers from years and months "
"down to weeks."
msgstr ""
"`AIRLink  <https://sky-drones.com/airlink>`__ 代表人工智能与远程链路。该单元集成了尖端无人机飞控、AI "
"任务计算机和 LTE 连接模块。AIRLink 可帮助新无人机制造商将上市时间从数年或数月缩短至数周。"

