#: ../../source/docs/common-skydrones-airlink.rst:101
#: 7431bcaafd0e48c4bc3a34b88bc6b12d
msgid ""
"AIRLink editions offer different integration levels required by drone "
"manufacturers: Enterprise and Core. AIRLink Enterprise is ideal for a quick "
"start, evaluation and prototyping while Core is optimised for deep "
"integration and mid-high volume manufacturing."
msgstr ""
"AIRLink 版本为无人机制造商提供不同的集成级别：Enterprise 和 Core。AIRLink Enterprise "
"适合快速启动、评估和原型开发，而 Core 针对深度集成和中高批量生产进行了优化。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skydrones-airlink.rst:103
#: bc0f221eba394b8084a2474d4b516fbb
msgid "**AIRLink Enterprise**"
