#: ../../source/docs/common-skydrones-airlink.rst:107
#: c752bcfa051d419cb5282ff8a1972e0d
msgid ""
"SmartAP AIRLink's Enterprise edition is intended for prototyping and low to "
"medium volume drone production. Quick and easy installation thanks to the "
"dedicated mounting holes and integrated heatsink for power dissipation."
msgstr "SmartAP AIRLink Enterprise 版适用于原型开发和中小批量无人机生产。得益于专用安装孔和集成散热片，安装快捷简便。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skydrones-airlink.rst:109
#: cd627cc0526a40cc8f55f3d023948a62
msgid "**AIRLink Core**"
msgstr "**AIRLink Core**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skydrones-airlink.rst:111
#: ce3738cbf97048639c31db802a4c7868
msgid ""
"SmartAP AIRLink's Core edition is intended for medium to high volume "
"production and deep integration with customer's hardware. It weighs only 89 "
"g and can be attached to a metal frame for optimum cooling."
msgstr "SmartAP AIRLink Core 版适用于中大批量生产和与客户硬件的深度集成。重量仅 89 克，可安装在金属机架上以实现最佳散热。"

